1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,260
I don't want nobody to get killed

2
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:22,780
I come and get you, I'm always ready to fight

3
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:29,140
So don't take all of the blame, we're always wet

4
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:32,860
Oh, I don't take all of the blame, you always do

5
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:36,620
There will always be something you cannot control

6
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,880
We will overcome, your salvation has begun

7
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:46,260
Those suns, those lights, such a mess, so lovely

8
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:54,860
Don't kill your walls, you make me realize who I need

9
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:59,660
I'll be there, hold on, the changes in power

10
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:02,540
So where are you now?

11
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:07,280
I'll reach you, my top, the shadows of the earth

12
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:10,400
Illusions are born

13
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:15,920
The golden end is still wrong, but I know it's a pain

14
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:19,100
I'll admit, I'm still human after all

15
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:22,140
Don't want to save you for the control

16
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:24,060
About your precious worth

17
00:01:24,060 --> 00:01:27,640
This scar may respond to your call

18
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:48,860
What are you waiting for?

19
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,240
Activate the curse and kill him

20
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:52,820
Hurry!

21
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:55,120
That's an order

22
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:57,780
I can't

23
00:01:57,780 --> 00:01:59,920
You damn rookie!

24
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,040
The hell!

25
00:02:16,460 --> 00:02:17,700
What was that?

26
00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:18,700
You had him

27
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:20,260
Why didn't you make the kill?

28
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:22,840
I think he...

29
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:27,860
Gorin, are you alright?

30
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,840
Worry about yourself, you idiot

31
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,880
Did you forget this is a war zone?

32
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:35,820
Keep your eyes on the enemy

33
00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:38,520
Hey moron, what's the deal?

34
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:41,460
You had that bloodsucker right where you wanted him

35
00:02:41,460 --> 00:02:43,840
Did you forget how to use your gear?

36
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,460
What's wrong?

37
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,060
You don't look so good

38
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:51,060
Well, you...

39
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:52,320
I'm sorry

40
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:55,740
But if that's who I think it is

41
00:02:55,740 --> 00:03:00,180
My family's with the vampires

42
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:04,320
Tell me!

43
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,320
Is it really you, Mikaela?

44
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:14,280
It is you

45
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:16,200
Mika

46
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:20,300
I'm so sorry

47
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:21,820
I abandoned you

48
00:03:21,820 --> 00:03:24,540
No, that's not true

49
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:30,120
Oh, this might be the sweetest thing I've ever seen

50
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:33,020
And just look at how much dear Yuichiro has sprouted

51
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:36,840
What a fateful and unexpected reunion for the three of us

52
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,440
Brings back so many memories

53
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:41,100
It's almost enough to bring tears to my eyes

54
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:43,320
So, what's the plan?

55
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:46,940
Your friend is most likely being manipulated by these humans

56
00:03:46,940 --> 00:03:48,940
I'm going to save him

57
00:03:48,940 --> 00:03:51,460
From the hands of these traitorous dogs?

58
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,400
Yes

59
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,560
But he's one of them

60
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:57,200
Do you really think a human could befriend us?

61
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,760
I'm sure he'd rather die

62
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:02,160
Ah, I know

63
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:05,340
I can do for him what Cruel did for you, Mika

64
00:04:05,340 --> 00:04:09,400
One drop of my blood and Yuichiro will be reborn

65
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:15,280
If you so much as try to lay a finger on him

66
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,440
I'll kill you

67
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,560
Oh, come now

68
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,580
I was only kidding

69
00:04:18,580 --> 00:04:21,400
You really need to learn to take a joke with your boy

70
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:25,760
Now, why don't I help you rescue your princess?

71
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:29,820
I'll deal with the other livestock while you rescue Yuichiro

72
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:32,200
Just leave it to me

73
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:35,700
All you need to worry about is getting him out of harm's way

74
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:39,260
I'm not surprised you've made new friends

75
00:04:39,260 --> 00:04:41,520
You've always been such a kind soul

76
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:44,200
But sometimes you can be too nice

77
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:47,220
So much so that people take advantage of you

78
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:49,640
The truth is

79
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:52,100
These friends you've made are faking it

80
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:53,940
They're greedy and deceitful

81
00:04:53,940 --> 00:04:55,180
All of them

82
00:04:55,180 --> 00:05:07,440
Very well

83
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,100
It's been decided

84
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:13,340
All of the humans will die except for the long-lost lamb Yuichiro

85
00:05:13,340 --> 00:05:15,900
Looks like I got here just in time

86
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:19,140
Sorry I'm running late, third progenitor

87
00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:22,400
Ah, Crowley, so glad you could make it to the party

88
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:24,360
Him again

89
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:27,200
I took a little detour on the way over here

90
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,400
Of course

91
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:30,260
Was anything interesting going on?

92
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:32,700
Well, now that you're here

93
00:05:32,700 --> 00:05:35,140
The game I had planned won't be quite as much fun

94
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:36,320
But

95
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:38,120
We could play a new one

96
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,900
It's called Take Them Alive

97
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:41,920
We'll capture the Moon Demon Company

98
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,280
And make them our livestock

99
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:45,300
I could get behind that

100
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:45,840
Damn

101
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:48,380
We were in trouble before this guy showed up

102
00:05:48,380 --> 00:05:49,940
I've got no choice

103
00:05:49,940 --> 00:05:51,740
Everyone!

104
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,500
Prepare to retreat!

105
00:05:53,500 --> 00:05:57,440
No, we can't just run away, damn it

106
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,640
Mika's my family

107
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,580
I won't leave them with these monsters

108
00:06:00,580 --> 00:06:01,540
Shut up

109
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:04,800
You're willing to let your comrades die for a vampire?

110
00:06:05,860 --> 00:06:06,420
You

111
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:11,540
Let's go

112
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:13,960
Please, you

113
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:18,020
Fall back

114
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:20,960
Keep your formation and retreat to the second defense line

115
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:28,700
Come on, don't you want to play?

116
00:06:29,300 --> 00:06:30,260
Break formation!

117
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,460
Damn you!

118
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,500
What the hell's gotten into you?

119
00:06:38,900 --> 00:06:39,320
Die!

120
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:40,600
You bastard!

121
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:49,900
Stop you!

122
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:51,380
What is that idiot thinking?

123
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:53,760
No, wait!

124
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:59,420
You are fast, but you've still got a lot to learn

125
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:10,800
And you should know by now that the injured lion's strike is never quite as sharp

126
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:15,380
Lieutenant Colonel!

127
00:07:15,380 --> 00:07:19,460
Move!

128
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:29,320
Try the hurry!

129
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:31,800
Oh wow!

130
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:37,340
Still standing?

131
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:39,420
Looks like we've got ourselves a hero

132
00:07:39,420 --> 00:07:43,380
Are you okay?

133
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,520
Don't worry

134
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,600
I'll be fine

135
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:49,440
These bastards don't have any intention of letting us get to Gurren

136
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:51,660
In that case, we'll just have to kill all of them

137
00:07:51,660 --> 00:07:53,460
Easier said than done, I'm afraid

138
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:55,960
That's why we're having all this trouble in the first place

139
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:59,080
The only way out of here is as livestock or corpses

140
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:00,400
So what's it going to be?

141
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,000
Well, we're waiting

142
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:19,660
Focus!

143
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:25,560
What are you doing?

144
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,360
Get on your feet!

145
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,300
Yeah, sorry

146
00:08:27,300 --> 00:08:28,720
Well, hello

147
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,260
So we meet again

148
00:08:30,260 --> 00:08:37,980
This time I'm not letting you get away from me

149
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:42,980
Goran!

150
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:48,980
Watch out!

151
00:08:48,980 --> 00:08:54,320
I've waited so long to get a taste of your-

152
00:08:54,320 --> 00:09:04,520
You see?

153
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:06,720
This is what I meant about taking a chute

154
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:10,920
Be sure to call me if you need a hand

155
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:12,600
Mika

156
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:18,560
Let's go

157
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:20,900
Leave everything behind and escape with me

158
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:21,500
Huh?

159
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,440
What do you mean escape?

160
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:24,680
Answer me

161
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,980
Why are you with the vampire who killed our family?

162
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:27,820
Never mind that

163
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:32,520
You!

164
00:09:34,180 --> 00:09:36,140
Don't take your eyes off the enemy

165
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:40,940
Hey!

166
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,060
Let go of me!

167
00:09:42,300 --> 00:09:43,400
Stop playing, Mika!

168
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:44,820
Tell me what's going on

169
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:46,280
You at least owe me that much!

170
00:09:46,340 --> 00:09:48,320
The short version is that you shouldn't be here

171
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,700
Not with the humans

172
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:51,120
They're just using me

173
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:51,420
What?

174
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:53,280
That's the dumbest thing I've ever heard

175
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:55,320
Shut up and put me down!

176
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,240
The humans are using me?

177
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,140
What are you saying?

178
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,080
Aren't you still alive?

179
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:20,020
Wait, you are human, right?

180
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:22,080
Don't tell me that they changed you

181
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:24,120
Is this because of me?

182
00:10:24,540 --> 00:10:26,100
Is this because I abandoned you?

183
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:27,200
No!

184
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,980
You didn't do anything wrong

185
00:10:28,980 --> 00:10:30,480
Then why, Mika?

186
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,160
Let's just go

187
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,920
It isn't safe here

188
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:38,920
Please, you

189
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,380
Come with me

190
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:43,760
No, I'm staying until it's over

191
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:44,800
It's just

192
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,320
They're friends

193
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,760
I can't leave

194
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:48,480
You're wrong!

195
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,200
They only see you as a tool

196
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,220
Please, you

197
00:10:51,220 --> 00:10:52,500
Trust me

198
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:53,780
I'm trying to save you

199
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:54,840
Before it's too late

200
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,840
Shinua!

201
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,340
Shinua!

202
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:08,260
Please, don't look back

203
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:09,760
There's nothing behind you

204
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,820
Nothing important

205
00:11:10,820 --> 00:11:13,140
Just come with me

206
00:11:13,140 --> 00:11:18,440
Let go of her!

207
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:23,020
Come on!

208
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:28,140
They're in trouble!

209
00:11:28,860 --> 00:11:30,820
There's nothing you can do to help them!

210
00:11:31,340 --> 00:11:32,020
Get off me!

211
00:11:33,140 --> 00:11:34,060
You can't!

212
00:11:34,500 --> 00:11:35,720
Just forget about them!

213
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,860
In the end, they'll betray you and toss you aside!

214
00:11:41,620 --> 00:11:42,100
Mitsuva!

215
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:45,060
Let's get out of here before they capture you!

216
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,900
I won't run away again!

217
00:11:53,020 --> 00:11:55,020
I won't run away again!

218
00:11:56,180 --> 00:11:58,180
Goju! Run!

219
00:11:59,740 --> 00:12:02,780
Hush, livestock don't speak. Please call them off.

220
00:12:02,860 --> 00:12:03,860
Hurry, Mika!

221
00:12:03,940 --> 00:12:07,180
You should be worried about yourself. It's too late for them now.

222
00:12:23,020 --> 00:12:32,180
You? What's the matter?

223
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:33,380
Murder, judge!

224
00:12:44,980 --> 00:12:45,980
Hush!

225
00:12:45,980 --> 00:13:02,600
Talk to me, Ashura Maru.

226
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:04,440
About what?

227
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:06,400
What's happening to me?

228
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:09,260
You're not trying to possess me, are you?

229
00:13:09,820 --> 00:13:12,200
No, this has nothing to do with me.

230
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:16,220
It seems we've got a big problem on our hands.

231
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:23,200
I've been around for a while, but I never thought I'd be terrified of a monster inside the human I was possessing.

232
00:13:24,420 --> 00:13:26,420
There, you see how the clouds are parting?

233
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:31,160
It's as if the heavens have opened to shine judgment on this cursed world.

234
00:13:32,380 --> 00:13:34,500
You know, I think your friend is right.

235
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,920
Listen to him and escape while you can.

236
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:39,320
This might be your one and only chance.

237
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:45,360
If you stay here, you won't be human for long.

238
00:13:46,740 --> 00:13:47,780
Wait, what?

239
00:13:47,780 --> 00:14:04,320
I'm afraid it's too late.

240
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:14,620
The non-human part of you is about to lose all control.

241
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:37,260
And so it begins.

242
00:14:37,260 --> 00:14:47,260
It's true.

243
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:50,020
The humans have been using him all along.

244
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,320
Snap out of it!

245
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,020
Please, you!

246
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:56,020
Leave this place with me!

247
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:59,500
You!

248
00:14:59,500 --> 00:14:59,880
Get your foot!

249
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:16,340
Oh, my God!

250
00:15:16,820 --> 00:15:17,320
Iramos!

251
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:17,720
prendo!

252
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,520
Let's just stand last chance.

253
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:25,020
Thank you, Angel!

254
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:30,020
I don't know what that is, but it doesn't look good.

255
00:15:48,020 --> 00:15:50,020
That's a lot of damage. Very impressive.

256
00:15:55,020 --> 00:16:07,020
No, Yu, stop!

257
00:16:09,020 --> 00:16:11,020
You went and got my clothes all dirty.

258
00:16:25,020 --> 00:16:27,020
Oh.

259
00:16:55,020 --> 00:16:58,020
That's one creepy monster.

260
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:01,720
Seriously, it's so revolting, I've completely lost my appetite.

261
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,320
What is that thing, Farid?

262
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:08,020
I don't know. Do you?

263
00:17:08,940 --> 00:17:11,260
Nah, we'll just have to wait and see.

264
00:17:13,900 --> 00:17:15,400
Let me guess.

265
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:19,360
This is the result of human experimentation, isn't it?

266
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:23,620
Tell me, where does that infinite greed of yours come from?

267
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:33,440
Honestly, it scares me.

268
00:17:33,980 --> 00:17:37,640
Besides, you always seem to be losing control of it.

269
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:39,320
See?

270
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:52,200
Sinners. Sinners must die. Sinners must all be annihilated.

271
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:55,140
No.

272
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:57,080
Shinoa!

273
00:17:58,280 --> 00:18:02,180
You're the only one who can help him. There's still a chance that he can come back.

274
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:30,860
No, you don't do it!

275
00:18:30,860 --> 00:18:33,220
You'd never be able to forgive yourself!

276
00:18:35,780 --> 00:18:39,520
Why? Why did you... save me?

277
00:18:40,700 --> 00:18:44,280
Shut up, human. This is happening because you used him!

278
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:50,140
Damn it. My injury won't heal.

279
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,280
Annihilate.

280
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:54,640
Every sinner.

281
00:18:59,320 --> 00:18:59,880
Shinilla!

282
00:19:00,620 --> 00:19:02,160
What are you waiting for?

283
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:03,840
Our lives depend on you!

284
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:04,620
Go!

285
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:15,980
Yuu, stop it!

286
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:17,120
Please, you have to!

287
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:19,240
For all of us are going to die!

288
00:19:19,420 --> 00:19:20,720
Don't you dare touch him!

289
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:23,080
Get your filthy hands off my family!

290
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:23,980
Stop it!

291
00:19:23,980 --> 00:19:35,440
Please, you!

292
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:37,100
Don't do it!

293
00:19:41,100 --> 00:19:42,460
Come back to us!

294
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:58,920
You!

295
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:00,800
I'm right here!

296
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:08,840
You're okay.

297
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:12,500
Damn you humans and your treachery.

298
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:15,440
You'll pay for this.

299
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:20,180
So how do you like my trump card?

300
00:20:20,420 --> 00:20:22,960
For a rookie, he puts on one hell of a show.

301
00:20:23,260 --> 00:20:25,900
Sadly for you, he didn't really achieve anything.

302
00:20:26,140 --> 00:20:27,340
I wouldn't be so sure.

303
00:20:27,900 --> 00:20:29,260
He's managed to distract you.

304
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:32,080
And that was our main objective all along.

305
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:41,560
Uh-oh, they've seen us.

306
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:43,820
But not soon enough to make a difference.

307
00:20:44,620 --> 00:20:47,000
Destroy our enemies, the Akomaru.

308
00:20:48,220 --> 00:20:50,680
Oh, and try not to hit Gurren, okay?

309
00:20:51,420 --> 00:20:51,760
Boom.

310
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:51,820
Boom.

311
00:20:51,820 --> 00:21:06,040
That was too close for comfort.

312
00:21:06,580 --> 00:21:08,100
If it hadn't been for his big mouth,

313
00:21:08,180 --> 00:21:10,160
that'd be a smoking pile of ash right now.

314
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:22,420
It appears we're surrounded.

315
00:21:24,800 --> 00:21:26,280
Not bad, Lieutenant Colonel.

316
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:29,280
I suppose Junior Branch garbage has its use.

317
00:21:30,980 --> 00:21:32,000
You're done here.

318
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:34,140
The Hiragi family will be taking over.

319
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:35,600
All right, men.

320
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:37,640
I want those nobles taken alive.

321
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:41,020
We need to show them once and for all

322
00:21:41,020 --> 00:21:42,100
what happens to anyone

323
00:21:42,100 --> 00:21:44,020
or anything that opposes humanity.

324
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:46,460
The Japanese Imperial Demon Army

325
00:21:46,460 --> 00:21:48,920
or the might of the Hiragi family.

326
00:21:51,620 --> 00:21:52,760
Here we go.

327
00:21:52,760 --> 00:22:01,700
Let's do it!

328
00:22:02,220 --> 00:22:02,880
Oh my goodness.

329
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:32,860
Thank you.

330
00:22:32,880 --> 00:23:02,860
Thank you.

331
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:32,860
Thank you.

332
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:38,360
Next time on Seraph of the End, everyone's a sinner.

